        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"cefa7f81-e9f1-4890-b6d0-427fb5191ffb\",\"review_text\":\"I want to rate -0 but unfortunately the smallest rate is 1 star 🫣😂\"},{\"review_id\":\"82c28ce3-e8ef-405d-b532-3d41765d8e68\",\"review_text\":\"Um modo session que não funciona, parabéns aos envolvidos. Trouxa sou eu que pago essa tranqueira\"},{\"review_id\":\"a00e4c54-f262-40dd-8b52-532c05d696a1\",\"review_text\":\"Bolta ha kee 30 min koee ad nhi daga 30 min sa pahlahe ad ajta ha\"},{\"review_id\":\"03b7b979-83b7-4f87-9e45-538b94a57f2c\",\"review_text\":\"This app is very nice listening to podcasts and music it really nice\"},{\"review_id\":\"efd8b262-aaab-4366-967a-c024dd074dfa\",\"review_text\":\"Just simplicity...\"},{\"review_id\":\"da5ec60a-d4e0-4931-813e-66ed3a8d7b43\",\"review_text\":\"Happy to use Spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"b501d9d4-4ab9-4bfb-955a-e55c66d9713b\",\"review_text\":\"Hype\"},{\"review_id\":\"24a92a5d-14fc-4b60-87f1-d5a4b99c7513\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify keeps stopping despite carrying out all the suggestions on the spotify website to prevent this. Will scrap my premium membership if this continues.\"},{\"review_id\":\"19781735-5ee7-414a-a034-bc33ccf91101\",\"review_text\":\"It was good but it frustrating me I'm paying and now you know the lyrics I can't copy anymore and yeah I miss a payment that I paid did I get charged again a couple days\"},{\"review_id\":\"a1d35f66-a046-4072-809d-e376460e4e24\",\"review_text\":\"I just love this app.. it's about the best music podcast there is.. I do recommend it\"}]}"
